      "global_start_sec": 171.175,
      "global_end_sec": 172.025,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "我直接把两天的安排交给它",
      "spoken": "我直接把两天的安排交给它：",
      "from": 249,
      "to": 313,
      "local_start_sec": 8.275,
      "global_start_sec": 172.025,
      "global_end_sec": 174.188,
      "size": 44
    },
    {
      "text": "\"帮我把这两天的安排",
